      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh okay good to hear. i was a bit worried because my head has been feeling kind of heavy and i have this dull ache in my temples too. it's probably just stress from the third trimester right? i feel like i should probably check with my doctor but i really dont want to go in for something that is just normal swelling and tiredness. do you think i can just wait until my regular appointment next week?",
