      "role": "user",
      "content": "ibuprofen?? wait i thought i wasnt supposed to take that while pregnant since i'm so close to my due date. is it actually safe to dose that much of it? also my stomach feels a bit tight and i have this weird pressure in my upper abdomen too... like right under my ribs. is that just the baby kicking or something?",
